* Sun May 10 2026 2.4.5-1
- Removed the UI-mode tier system (`showGuimode` + `guimode` dconf keys):
  - Dropped the "UI mode" SectionHeader and the easy/full/advanced
    ComboBox from OptionsPage (and the side-effecting easy `onClicked`
    that disabled servicesu, the autoupdate timer, the second cover
    action and density). All settings are now always shown, including
    the former developer-only Icon updater (OptionsPage) and Backup &
    restore icons (GuidePage) sections.
  - Dropped `guimode` / `showGuimode` from Settings.qml (orphan dconf
    keys on existing devices are harmless).
  - Dropped the easy-mode-only "After confirming, your device will
    restart..." LabelText from ConfirmPage / RestorePage / RestoreDDPage
    and the redundant easy-mode overlay LabelText from ConfirmPage.
  - Keyboard handlers in MainPage / OptionsPage / AboutPage / GuidePage
    / TranslatorPage no longer gate Key_D / Key_W on `guimode`.
- Removed the "Custom build" feature:
  - Deleted docs/custom-build.md and the README "Custom builds" section.
  - Deleted scripts/sailfishos-uithemer.txt (the vendor dconf defaults
    file). %post no longer moves it into /etc/dconf/db/vendor.d/ and
    %preun no longer removes it. On upgrade, %post deletes any stale
    /etc/dconf/db/vendor.d/sailfishos-uithemer.txt left by older
    installs and refreshes the dconf db.
- Translations: dropped 8 now-orphan source strings (UI mode, easy,
  full, advanced, the three guimode descriptions, and "After
  confirming, your device will restart...") from every locale.
- Version bumped to 2.4.5; AboutPage label updated.

* Sun May 10 2026 2.4.4-1
- Removed sound theming (the Sailfish system sound theme that copied
  WAVs into /usr/share/sounds/jolla-ambient/stereo):
  - Dropped tps/sound-{run,restore,backup,menu,reinstall}.sh.
  - Removed the (S)ound theme entry from the CLI menu
    (tps/themepacksupport.sh).
  - One-click restore (tps/ocr.sh) no longer calls sound-restore.sh.
  - ConfirmPage / RestorePage / RecoveryPage no longer expose sound
    options; CoverPage no longer shows the active sound pack chip.
  - ThemePackModel slots applyTheme / restoreTheme / recoveryTheme
    no longer take a `sound` argument; hasSound() removed.
  - Settings.qml drops activeSoundPack (orphan dconf key on existing
    devices is harmless); scripts/sailfishos-uithemer.txt no longer
    seeds it.
  - On upgrade, %pretrans runs the still-on-disk sound-restore.sh once
    so the user's themed sounds are reverted to defaults BEFORE the
    new package wipes the script. %post then removes sound-current
    and backup/sound. Theme packs may still ship a `sound/` directory
    but it is silently ignored.
  - %pretrans no longer neutralises sound-restore.sh from older
    harbour-themepacksupport installs, %preun no longer invokes it.
  - Translations: dropped sound-only source strings; AboutPage and
    GuidePage / OptionsPage advanced-settings copy were rephrased to
    drop "sounds" and marked unfinished for translators.

* Sun May 10 2026 2.4.3-1
- Native icon lookup is now keyed off the .desktop's Icon= value (not its
  filename). This restores matches for built-in Jolla apps whose .desktop
  basename does not match the icon name, e.g. jolla-camera.desktop ships
  Icon=icon-launcher-camera, so a pack only needs icon-launcher-camera.png.
- Added pre-3.0 Jolla ambient subtree as a lookup-only fallback:
  <pack>/jolla/<zSize>/icons/<key>.png is consulted after native sizes for
  packs that still ship ambient artwork. PNGs under jolla/ are referenced
  via Icon= only, never copied into the system theme tree (graphic theming
  removal from 2.4.2 stays intact).
- nativeMatchCount, applyIcons and themeNewDesktops all read Icon= from
  the .desktop and pass it as the lookup key. APK lookup is unchanged.
- No system-tree writes; restore / reassert / manifest behaviour unchanged.

* Sun May 10 2026 2.4.2-1
- Removed graphic theming (the Sailfish system widget icons under
  /usr/share/themes/sailfish-default/meegotouch/icons/):
  - Dropped tps/graphic-{run,restore,menu,backup}.sh.
  - Removed the (G)raphic theme entry from the CLI menu
    (tps/themepacksupport.sh).
  - One-click restore (tps/ocr.sh) no longer calls graphic-restore.sh.
  - %pretrans no longer neutralises graphic-restore.sh from older
    harbour-themepacksupport installs, %preun no longer invokes it,
    and %post no longer touches or migrates graphic-current.
  - Stale graphic-current state file (if any) is removed on upgrade.

* Sun May 10 2026 2.4.1-1
- Race fixes:
  - flock(2) on /usr/share/sailfishos-uithemer/icon-backup.lock serialises
    GUI apply / restore / reassert / refresh against the helper binary and
    the systemupgrade.service.
  - applyIcons commits each manifest entry BEFORE rewriting the .desktop
    file, so a crash mid-apply no longer poisons original_icon snapshots.
  - reassertCurrentTheme self-heals: snapshots a drifted Icon= as the new
    original before re-clobbering, and falls back to original_icon (and
    drops the entry) when themed_icon vanished.
- New auto-theming: QFileSystemWatcher on /usr/share/applications and
  /home/defaultuser/.local/share/applications themes any newly-installed
  app while a theme is active (no manual re-apply needed).
- Uninstalling the active icon pack now restores originals first so
  .desktop files do not end up pointing at a path that is about to vanish.

* Sun May 10 2026 2.4.0-1
- Icons applied by rewriting Icon= in .desktop files; no more PNG copies.
- Drop ImageMagick dependency; overlays and previews rendered with Qt.
- New JSON manifest /usr/share/sailfishos-uithemer/icon-backup.json tracks originals.
- New helper /usr/bin/sailfishos-uithemer-reassert (--reassert/--restore/--refresh-originals).
- New oneshot sailfishos-uithemer-reassert.service re-asserts the active theme at boot.
- systemupgrade.service now restores originals via the helper before system updates.
- autoupdate.service / timer driven by the helper; legacy run.sh becomes a thin shim.
- Drop Jolla ambient (z*), DynCal and DynClock support.
- Drop Tools backup/restore icons UI; covered by the manifest now.

* Sat May 10 2026 2.3.1-1
- APK launcher icons: /home/defaultuser/.local/share/apkd-bridge/launcherIcon (flat).
- Remove aliendalvik.service drop-in; APK refresh in autoupdate service/run.sh.

* Fri May 09 2026 2.3.0-1
- Merge Theme pack support engine into UI Themer; obsolete harbour-themepacksupport.
- Single install root under /usr/share/sailfishos-uithemer/; keep themepacksupport CLI.

